        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Alder Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAt Doorware.com we love RK International's<a href=\"/collections/rk-international\">extensive line of cabinet hardware</a> because we fell in love with the timelessness of their products such as the Alder Cabinet Pull. What we love about this pull is how versatile it is--its classic design will look great in almost any setting. We imagine this as the perfect finishing touch to upscale rental homes, where versatility is a must for renters with different tastes. However, the Adler Cabinet Pull is so beautiful you probably will adorn your own cabinets with it. Available in 96mm, 6 inch, and 8 inch lengths in 7 stunning finishes making it the perfect choice for any space.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/alder-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-161\"><b>Matching Alder Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-661:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 96 mm</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-662:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-663:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55P_size.gif?v=1704354566\" width\"454\" height=\"156\" border=\"0\" atl=\"RKI International Alder Cabinet Pull Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Alder Cabinet Pull",
                "description": "RK International Alder Cabinet Pull - RK International is a new brand for us at doorware.com but we had to add their extensive line of cabinet hardware because we fell in love with the timelessness of their products such as the Alder Cabinet Pull. What we love about this pull is how versatile it is--its classic design will look great in almost any setting. We imagine this as the perfect finishing touch to upscale rental homes, where versatility is a must for renters with different tastes. However, the Adler Cabinet Pull is so beautiful you probably will adorn your own cabinets with it. Available in 96mm, 6 inch, and 8 inch lengths in 7 stunning finishes making it the perfect choice for any space.",
